{
"cmd"
:
"x env ls"
,
"en"
:
"List the software currently in use in the current sphere environment along with their version information"
,
"zh"
:
"列出当前 sphere 环境中正在使用的软件及其版本信息"
,
"de"
:
"Die im aktuellen Sphere-Umfeld verwendete Software samt Versionsangaben auflisten"
,
